h82Nl-fyIEz_7jv2OmVTYnQXMNif6mVm-lRcdGcGInrY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSa4nhJZ5FZNrjVzzPp8C3A7zWsyffPDwA-3411d-8lgg&oe=6B05A502"}, "display_name": "TRAP LIFE VR", "keywords": ["VROpenWorld", "VRSandbox", "VRRoleplay", "OpenWorldAdventure", "SocialSimulation"], "long_description": "Welcome to Trap Life VR \u2014  Open-world multiplayer sandbox built for VR, where stylized street life meets chaos, clout, and community.\n\nSet in the gritty, stylized city of Stonepark, you\u2019ll grind, flex, and rise through the ranks in a world built for hustlers, shot-callers, and street legends.\n\n\ud83d\ude97 High-Speed Pursuits\n{1109388807931507}\n\ud83d\ude81 Vehicles (cars, bikes, helicopters, and more)\n{1387021693036154}\n\ud83d\udd2b Raids\n{1507847253859794}\n\u2022 Stack paper in dynamic hustle loops\n\u2022 Trick out your whips, drip, and trap house\n\u2022 Hit licks or defend turf in PvP \n\u2022 Form a crew, earn clout, and level up your rep\n\u2022 Watch your Heat level rise as the city reacts to your moves\n\n\ud83d\udd25 Why Trap Life VR Slaps\n\nSpatial audio. Full-body avatars. Proximity chat. A living city that\u2019s always watching. Built from the ground up for Meta Quest, this is where roleplay, chaos, and competition collide.\n\nWhether you\u2019re flexing on opps or vibing with your crew, Trap Life VR rewards creativity, ambition, and raw charisma.\n\n\ud83d\udea8 Join the community\n\nTap in with us on Discord for exclusive drops, events, and early access perks:\nhttps://discord.gg/traplifevr", "short_description": "Step into the streets with Trap Life VR \u2014 an immersive multiplayer sandbox set in a stylized urban world. Hustle, ball, raid, or rise through music. The streets are yours.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://traplifevr.com/policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://traplifevr.com/terms", "publisher_name": "SupErWin Studios", "support_website_url": null, 